  "body": [
    {
      "line_index": 0,
      "verse": "1:1",
      "dropcap": "T",
      "text": "THE Seniour to the Lady Elect and her children,"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 1,
      "verse": "1:1",
      "text": "whom I loue in truth, and not I only , but alſo"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 2,
      "verse": "1:1",
      "text": "al that haue knowen the truth , 2. for the truth",
      "verse_starts_midline": [
        "1:2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_index": 3,
      "verse": "1:2",
      "text": "which abideth in vs , and ſhal be with vs for"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 4,
      "verse": "1:2",
      "text": "euer. 3. Grace be with you , mercie , peace from",
      "verse_starts_midline": [
        "1:3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_index": 5,
      "verse": "1:3",
      "text": "God the Father, and from Chriſt Iesvs the Sonne"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 6,
      "verse": "1:3",
      "text": "of the Father in truth, and charitie."
    },
    {
      "line_index": 7,
      "verse": "1:4",
      "verse_number_printed": "4",
      "text": "4. I was exceeding glad , becauſe I haue found"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 8,
      "verse": "1:4",
      "text": "of thy children walking in truth , as we haue re-",
      "line_end_hyphen": true
    },
    {
      "line_index": 9,
      "verse": "1:4",
      "text": "ceiued commandement of the Father. 5. And now I beſeech thee Lady,",
      "verse_starts_midline": [
        "1:5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_index": 10,
      "verse": "1:5",
      "text": "not as writing a new commandement to thee , but that which we haue"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 11,
      "verse": "1:5",
      "text": "had ‖ from the beginning , * that we loue one another. 6.*And this is",
      "marks_present": [
        "‖",
        "*"
      ],
      "verse_starts_midline": [
        "1:6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_index": 12,
      "verse": "1:6",
      "text": "charitie, that we walke according to his commandements. For this is"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 13,
      "verse": "1:6",
      "text": "the commandement, that as you haue heard from the beginning , you"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 14,
      "verse": "1:6",
      "text": "walke in the ſame:7. becauſe many ſeducers are gone out into the",
      "verse_starts_midline": [
        "1:7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_index": 15,
      "verse": "1:7",
      "text": "world, which doe not confeſſe Iesvs Chriſt to haue come into fleſh:this"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 16,
      "verse": "1:7",
      "text": "is a ſeducer and an Antichriſt."
    },
    {
      "line_index": 17,
      "verse": "1:8",
      "verse_number_printed": "8",
      "text": "8. Looke to your ſelues , that you loſe not the things which you haue"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 18,
      "verse": "1:8",
      "text": "wrought : but that you may receiue a ful ‖ reward. 9. Euery one that",
      "marks_present": [
        "‖"
      ],
      "verse_starts_midline": [
        "1:9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_index": 19,
      "verse": "1:9",
      "text": "c reuolteth, and perſiſteth not in the doctrine of Chriſt , hath not God.",
      "ref_letters_present": [
        "c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_index": 20,
      "verse": "1:9",
      "text": "He that perſiſteth in the doctrine , the ſame hath both the Father , and"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 21,
      "verse": "1:9",
      "text": "the Sonne. 10. If * any man come to you, and bring not ‖ this doctrine,",
      "marks_present": [
        "*",
        "‖"
      ],
      "verse_starts_midline": [
